0202]},{"nodeId":400860202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":704275250,"text":"神子、もう帰るのか？スメールでそんなに遊んでないんじゃないか…","nextNodeIds":[400860203]},{"nodeId":400860203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":12141570,"text":"いいや、とっくに満喫したぞ。おかげで、今回の取材は順調じゃった。貴重なバトルでの経験を手に入れた上、陰謀を暴く素晴らしい劇まで観られたからのう…","nextNodeIds":[400860204]},{"nodeId":400860204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3529426634,"text":"左右加にはオリジナルキャラを捨ててもらって、次は汝らを主人公にした小説でも書いてもらおうかのう！","nextNodeIds":[400860205,400860206]},{"nodeId":400860205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1171474466,"text":"#{M#君}{F#あなた}も裏で動いてた。","nextNodeIds":[400860207]},{"nodeId":400860207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4061184946,"text":"そうだ！ようやくわかったぞ！神子は何度もヒントをくれてたよな！","nextNodeIds":[400860208]},{"nodeId":400860208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":621164834,"text":"もっと早くエルヒンゲンの陰謀を暴けたはずなのに、どうして遠回りしてたんだ？","nextNodeIds":[400860209]},{"nodeId":400860209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":879173306,"text":"初めに真相を突き止めてしもうたら、興ざめじゃろ？汝らがこの局面をどう打破するか、見てみたかったんじゃ。結果から見れば、とんでもない驚きの連続じゃった…","nextNodeIds":[400860210]},{"nodeId":400860210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2173869770,"text":"最初、妾は汝らとキノコンの物語は「主」と「従者」から展開すると思っておった。じゃが汝らは、もっとよい答えを導き出した…それは平等な契りである、「仲間」という概念じゃ。","nextNodeIds":[400860211]},{"nodeId":400860211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3692137266,"text":"別の角度から考えれば…いつも「主」のことを考えるエルヒンゲンが、汝らに敵わなかったのも当然じゃな。まあ、あやつの腕なら、しばらくは騒ぎが止まんじゃろうが…","nextNodeIds":[400860212]},{"nodeId":400860212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":399172354,"text":"う、またついていけなくなったぞ…今度は神子の言葉をメモして、帰ってしっかり研究しよう。","nextNodeIds":[400860213]},{"nodeId":400860213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1532280674,"text":"さて、世間話はここまでじゃ…百雷遮羅のことは頼んだぞ。こやつの面倒を見てやってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[400860214]},{"nodeId":400860214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":199662722,"text":"汝らとハニヤーはますます頑張らんとな。こんなに面白い大会が続くかどうかは、汝らの努力にかかっておる。ちょっとは楽しみにしておるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":400860206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":20533210,"text":"エルヒンゲンが怪しいって分かってたんでしょ…","nextNodeIds":[400860207]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4008602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q4008602_guide"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":4008603,"order":4,"stepDescription":"ハニヤーと合流する","stepDescTextMapHash":3083073564,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4008603,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q4008603_guide"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[4008603],"talks":[{"talkId":4008603,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"dec